-- title:
--   Artin local covers with algebraically closed residue field
-- statement:
--   Let $C$ be a commutative ring that is local and Artinian and whose residue field is finite. The assertion is the existence of a type $D$, carrying a commutative ring structure, a local ring structure and the property of being Artinian, together with a $C$-algebra structure on $D$, and of a natural number $\ell$ which is prime, such that: $D$ is faithfully flat as a $C$-module; the structure homomorphism $\mathrm{algebraMap}\ C\ D$ is a local homomorphism, i.e. it pulls non-units back to non-units; the ideal of $D$ generated by the image of the maximal ideal of $C$ equals the maximal ideal of $D$, so that $C \to D$ is unramified in the sense $\mathfrak m_C D = \mathfrak m_D$; and the residue field of $D$ is algebraically closed of characteristic $\ell$. No relation between $\ell$ and $C$ is stated in the conclusion beyond this, although in the construction $\ell$ is the characteristic of the residue field of $C$. All data are existentially quantified, so the statement provides no canonical choice of $D$.
--
--   This is the Artin-local base change that replaces a finite residue field by an algebraically closed one while keeping faithful flatness and the equality $\mathfrak m_C D = \mathfrak m_D$; it is the local input to [`MvPolynomial.exists_faithfullyFlat_algHom_lift_family_of_forall_isArtinianRing_exists_algHom_lift`](thm.html#MvPolynomial.exists_faithfullyFlat_algHom_lift_family_of_forall_isArtinianRing_exists_algHom_lift), where points of a scheme over Artin local rings with finite residue field are produced after a faithfully flat cover.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_IsArtinianRing_exists_faithfullyFlat_isLocalHom_isAlgClosed_residueField_of_finite_residueField.lean

import Mathlib

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

set_option autoImplicit false

open IsLocalRing

theorem IsArtinianRing.exists_faithfullyFlat_isLocalHom_isAlgClosed_residueField_of_finite_residueField
    (C : Type) [CommRing C] [IsLocalRing C] [IsArtinianRing C] [Finite (ResidueField C)] :
    ∃ (D : Type) (_ : CommRing D) (_ : IsLocalRing D) (_ : IsArtinianRing D) (_ : Algebra C D) (ℓ : ℕ) (_ : Fact ℓ.Prime),
      Module.FaithfullyFlat C D ∧ IsLocalHom (algebraMap C D) ∧
      Ideal.map (algebraMap C D) (maximalIdeal C) = maximalIdeal D ∧
      IsAlgClosed (ResidueField D) ∧ CharP (ResidueField D) ℓ := by sorry
